        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9013P/415, Urban Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Urban Door Handle is definitely a showstopper; and in modern homes, it is the finishing detail that shows you have an eye for design and sleek, simple lines.  It is constructed out of solid brass and is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil-rubbed bronze. The Urban Door Handle is 17-15/16 inches long. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima I 9013P/415 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 16-5/16\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9013P/415 Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-urban-door-pull-pair-omnia-btb-9013p-415\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
